RULE_VERSION: 1.1
RULE_NAME: AI_MEETING_ASSISTANT
APP_TYPE: AI
TARGET: PI_SOLOHOST
GOAL: A meeting assistant that turns notes into useful summaries and action items.

PHASES:
- Meeting capture
- AI summarization
- Action items
- Meeting history
- Provider error handling
- SoloHost runtime verification

REQUIRED CAPABILITIES:
- Meeting notes
- AI summarization
- Action items
- Meeting history
- Error handling
- SoloHost runtime compatibility

FUNCTIONAL ACCEPTANCE:
- User can enter or import meeting notes
- A configured AI provider can produce a summary
- Action items are extracted and editable
- Meeting history persists when enabled
- AI/provider failure is handled without app crash

QUESTIONS:
- Which AI provider should be the default?
- Should users be allowed to enter their own provider key?

SECRETS:
AI_PROVIDER_API_KEY

STOP CONDITIONS:
- AI credentials are required but unavailable
- Provider request cannot be verified

MAX_CYCLES: 4
AUTO_REPAIR: true
